cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Event Staffing Planner: arrival forecasts and gate staffing plans for event planners, in Claude and on the web"
abstract: "A research prototype that forecasts guest arrivals per entrance and hour with an 80% range split into day-to-day variation and limited history, turns planners' notes into constraints they confirm before anything changes, and finds staffing plans that trade staff cost against guest waiting with a multi-objective evolutionary algorithm (NSGA-II). It runs as a website and as an MCP server whose charts appear inside Claude."
authors:
